<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of ecuadorean coffee, effective from August 14 to August 20 the 1997.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 180.41</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 170.24</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  58.57</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 136.14</p>
</text>
